Purpose: these two baseline failures are the ONLY deterministic reds blocking required-checks success on adapter head fa343068 (PR #2) and frozen P2a head 5a46bf1d (PR #1). Python job 102855956702 (run 34468796495) failed with «assert 409 == 200» in the two quickstart tests; JS job 102855956066 failed with a single 5053ms>5000ms vitest timeout. Root cause: tests call the real hardware.probe_budget(planning=True) — on a 16 GiB GitHub-hosted runner no catalog variant fits, route correctly 409s.

